              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this I saw the temple in heaven open, with the Sacred Tent in it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seven angels who had the seven plagues came out of the temple, dressed in clean shining linen and with gold belts tied around their chests. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then one of the four living creatures gave the seven angels seven gold bowls full of the anger of God, who lives for ever and ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
